      "review_description": "I came across the website after talking to 5 providers and Daniel the \"CEO\" came to see me on a Saturday afternoon and gave me a no BS quote and information about Solar panels and inverters. Daniel is down to earth that you can not help but believe and trust in what he say. He gave a quote and when I accepted the quote he did not even want a deposit. The installers came on the scheduled date and completed the job on the same day. What surprised me was, on the installation date my funds were not ready but Daniel was not worried and just advise me to pay him the following week which I did. Daniel and his installers did everything for me, I just received txt from Energex and after 15 days my Solar system was connected to the grid. I also want to give credit to AGL for the prompt service. Daniel always response to my txt and email regardless of what day or time of the day. I call that Service. I highly recommend Qld Solar and lighting to everybody especially to Seniors like me who are overwhelmed by all the Solar hype and sales pitch.",
